{
  "$schema": "../../schemas/vector.schema.json",
  "id": "content/auto-tune-regenerate-note-split",
  "type": "request",
  "description": "AUTO regenerate with params.noteSplitCents, the note-split sensitivity of the note generator, over the same range and notes as content/auto-tune-regenerate. The notes in the range are replaced as there; how many are created depends on the audio and on the sensitivity. paramsUsed reports the sensitivity that was used, and the members left out take the generator defaults.",
